WEBVTT

00:08.880 --> 00:10.820
Hello.

00:10.890 --> 00:13.680
Why do you look so sad?

00:14.960 --> 00:17.290
I see. Unrequited love.

00:17.360 --> 00:19.590
Don't let it get you down.

00:19.660 --> 00:22.630
I know I'm not much, but...

00:22.700 --> 00:26.000
I'll do my best
to cheer you up.

00:27.770 --> 00:31.970
You really need me.
Right from the heart.

00:33.640 --> 00:37.040
That's it. I'll stay with you
for as long as it takes.

01:05.240 --> 01:08.510
I'll always be with you!

01:24.160 --> 01:26.390
Just a dream.

03:35.360 --> 03:36.650
It wasn't a dream!

03:36.720 --> 03:40.590
My own video girl
is living with me!

03:46.800 --> 03:48.670
This soup is edible.

03:48.740 --> 03:52.100
Last night's dinner
was pretty scary.

03:53.440 --> 03:55.170
"YOTA"

03:55.240 --> 03:56.580
"AI"

03:58.780 --> 04:01.940
Get a grip!
Moemi's the only girl for you!

04:02.020 --> 04:05.320
Yota Moteuchi,
never forget it!

04:06.150 --> 04:07.780
Yota!

04:16.260 --> 04:17.990
What was that about?

04:23.170 --> 04:26.370
Look what you've done to my boobs!
They're practically gone!

04:26.440 --> 04:29.240
- Yeah.
- "Yeah"?

04:29.310 --> 04:33.680
My boobs are my favorite
part of my body!

04:36.380 --> 04:39.290
I'm talkin' like a guy!
My boobs are almost gone!

04:39.350 --> 04:43.480
It's all your fault! You played me
on that broken VCR of yours.

04:43.560 --> 04:46.550
Gimme my boobs back!

04:47.800 --> 04:50.960
- You got that?
- I get it!Just put some clothes on.

04:51.030 --> 04:52.130
Doesn't anything embarrass you?

04:52.200 --> 04:54.640
Lookin' at them
won't make them disappear!

04:54.700 --> 04:58.160
- Ain't nothin' left of 'em anyway!
- Right!

05:02.310 --> 05:05.680
Don't agree with me!

05:13.960 --> 05:15.890
Now I feel better.

05:15.960 --> 05:19.550
Moemi's the only one for me,
all right.

05:22.900 --> 05:26.730
<i>I told you I was in love</i>
<i>with Niimai, didn't I?</i>

05:28.070 --> 05:31.340
<i>Sorry, you're not my type.</i>

05:32.740 --> 05:36.040
<i>If I had been a little more aware...</i>

05:36.110 --> 05:39.050
<i>she wouldn't have had</i>
<i>to say it.</i>

05:45.620 --> 05:48.280
I wonder how Moemi will feel
when she sees Takashi.

05:48.360 --> 05:50.660
I bet she'll be depressed.

05:50.730 --> 05:53.790
You always worry about
other people.

05:53.860 --> 05:55.730
You're an endangered species.

05:58.600 --> 06:01.190
But that's saving grace number two.

06:07.240 --> 06:11.140
<i>Ai was almost nice today.</i>
<i>Maybe she's over the chest thing.</i>

06:12.080 --> 06:15.810
<i>But this is bad. Takashi</i>
<i>probably misunderstood everything.</i>

06:15.880 --> 06:18.680
<i>How will I be able</i>
<i>to face them?</i>

06:18.750 --> 06:20.810
What a mess.

06:20.890 --> 06:22.320
Yo, Yota!

06:24.060 --> 06:26.030
- You're cheerful.
- Why not?

06:26.090 --> 06:29.660
That's right. I was going to
tell you over the phonelast night.

06:29.730 --> 06:30.820
Moemi...

06:32.170 --> 06:35.830
made that joke about being
in love with me, right?

06:35.900 --> 06:37.030
Don't let it get to you.

06:37.100 --> 06:39.840
"Joke"? But you--

06:39.910 --> 06:43.900
I'll help fix you up,
so don't worry.

06:44.910 --> 06:47.810
Yota, is this that
Takashi dude?

06:48.620 --> 06:50.550
Ai!

06:54.060 --> 06:55.110
Hiya!

06:55.190 --> 06:57.350
My god, everybody!

06:57.430 --> 06:59.620
Yota brought a GIRL
to school!

06:59.690 --> 07:01.420
What!?

07:03.160 --> 07:05.830
"Dateless" has a girl!

07:05.900 --> 07:09.700
I-It's not like that!
I--She-- Uh--

07:09.770 --> 07:11.170
She's my sister!

07:11.840 --> 07:13.710
Is that all?

07:13.770 --> 07:15.740
We shoulda known.

07:15.810 --> 07:18.210
The loser with a girl?
Please!

07:18.280 --> 07:22.110
You guys?
Anybody there?

07:27.860 --> 07:30.480
Why did you come to school?

07:30.560 --> 07:33.190
I promised I'd always
be with you.

07:33.260 --> 07:38.500
And our objective is
to hook you and Moemi up.

07:38.570 --> 07:40.660
Gotta find out
who I'm dealing with.

07:40.740 --> 07:43.640
But things are different now!

07:43.700 --> 07:46.300
The situation is more complicated
than you--

07:46.370 --> 07:47.740
My boobs, please.

07:47.810 --> 07:49.940
Still mad, huh?

07:50.010 --> 07:51.540
I can stay, right?

07:51.610 --> 07:52.980
Guess so--

07:54.950 --> 07:59.180
But do me a favor
and stay outta my way?

07:59.250 --> 08:00.350
Okay!

08:05.760 --> 08:06.820
<i>It's Moemi!</i>

08:07.300 --> 08:08.760
<i>W-What am I gonna do!?</i>

08:08.830 --> 08:11.230
<i>H-How should I look!?</i>

08:11.300 --> 08:13.200
Good morning, Moteuchi.

08:14.440 --> 08:17.030
G-Good morning.

08:17.100 --> 08:20.340
Let's go.
It's the bell.

09:37.790 --> 09:41.620
Moteuchi?
Could we talk for a sec?

09:41.690 --> 09:43.160
Huh?

09:53.970 --> 09:56.300
I cried a little last night.

09:56.370 --> 10:01.640
Niimai may have been kidding
or serious, but I was in shock.

10:04.010 --> 10:05.980
What you said was right.

10:09.020 --> 10:12.350
"Don't give up!
You don't know how he feels!"

10:12.420 --> 10:15.250
So, I decided not to give up...

10:15.320 --> 10:17.850
and give it another try.

10:18.090 --> 10:20.290
Good for you.

10:20.390 --> 10:22.920
So, I'll do my best.

10:23.000 --> 10:25.760
You'll help me,
won't you, Moteuchi?

10:25.830 --> 10:27.530
'Course I will.

10:28.470 --> 10:30.460
Good.

10:36.980 --> 10:40.510
You're such a nice guy!

10:56.930 --> 10:59.230
Your boobs are huge!

11:03.900 --> 11:06.600
Sorry! My little sister's
so rude!

11:06.670 --> 11:10.870
It's okay.
See you later.

11:13.150 --> 11:14.880
Adios!

11:18.650 --> 11:21.650
Grow up!
What was that for?

11:26.430 --> 11:29.590
"You're such a nice guy!"

11:29.660 --> 11:33.120
- You see?
- You heard, huh?

11:34.000 --> 11:35.300
I am an idiot, though.

11:36.100 --> 11:38.800
Helping the girl I love
date another man.

11:38.870 --> 11:41.210
I'm the biggest idiot
in the world.

11:41.280 --> 11:44.300
Guess you like girls
with really big hooters.

11:44.380 --> 11:47.040
I... I...
I never said that!

11:47.720 --> 11:50.180
You're right.
You are an idiot.

11:50.250 --> 11:53.190
But idiots like you are cute.

11:57.560 --> 12:02.430
She doesn't hate you, so you've still
got a chance with her.

12:31.230 --> 12:34.720
- Get a load of that guy!
- What's he doing?

12:34.800 --> 12:36.320
Gives me the creeps!

12:40.230 --> 12:42.900
What are you doing, Moteuchi?

12:53.250 --> 12:55.580
I did it again!

12:55.650 --> 12:57.680
But I won't give up.

12:57.750 --> 13:00.650
I'm gonna make somethin'
good for a change!

13:13.630 --> 13:15.300
It's great!

13:15.370 --> 13:17.740
With just a little effort,
I can cook!

13:19.040 --> 13:23.410
I'm becoming such a good cook
that I scare myself.

13:24.680 --> 13:27.410
I can't wait to see
Yota's face!

13:27.480 --> 13:28.710
I'm home!

13:28.780 --> 13:30.680
I've been waiting for you, Yota!

13:30.750 --> 13:32.010
Welcome--

13:39.290 --> 13:41.160
Sorry to intrude.

13:41.230 --> 13:43.130
Welcome.

13:44.730 --> 13:48.290
Moemi says that she wants
to cook dinner!

13:51.210 --> 13:55.200
He's been so nice
about listening to my problems.

13:55.280 --> 13:57.010
I wanted to thank him.

13:57.080 --> 14:00.050
Something smells good.

14:00.110 --> 14:02.380
No kidding!
Smells delicious!

14:02.450 --> 14:05.390
That must be
our next-door neighbors.

14:06.150 --> 14:10.920
Listen, the kitchen's a mess.
Take five while I clean it up.

14:10.990 --> 14:12.720
I'll help you clean.

14:12.790 --> 14:16.160
No, no!
Go up and wait in Yota's room.

14:21.770 --> 14:24.710
You didn't go and make dinner,
did you?

14:24.770 --> 14:27.070
Come on! Not a chance.

14:27.140 --> 14:29.670
Well, I guess
I'd better hit the kitchen!

14:30.440 --> 14:32.940
That's strange.
Why would--

14:33.010 --> 14:34.350
The picture!

14:36.420 --> 14:37.510
Moemi!

14:38.320 --> 14:39.750
What?

14:40.420 --> 14:42.080
Thank God!

14:46.030 --> 14:47.890
Wait a sec.

14:50.760 --> 14:53.030
- C-Come in!
- Here I come!

14:53.970 --> 14:57.170
<i>So, the clueless Yota</i>
<i>got Moemi here.</i>

14:57.240 --> 14:59.210
<i>Whaddaya know.</i>

14:59.270 --> 15:02.640
So, this is your room, huh?

15:03.640 --> 15:07.100
<i>Moemi! Moemi is actually</i>
<i>in my room!</i>

15:07.980 --> 15:11.540
<i>My day has come!</i>
<i>I'm so happy!</i>

15:11.620 --> 15:14.520
Would you like to sit down?

15:22.060 --> 15:23.790
<i>Moemi's rear-end</i>
<i>on MY bed!</i>

15:23.860 --> 15:26.700
What a nice room.

15:27.430 --> 15:30.400
What I'd give to be that bed.

15:32.040 --> 15:35.010
<i>Aileft 'em</i>
<i>on my bed again.</i>

15:53.830 --> 15:56.760
W-We're kissing distance.

16:11.710 --> 16:12.810
Yota...

16:12.880 --> 16:15.780
whatcha doin' holding a pair
of panties, you dog?

16:15.850 --> 16:18.880
Ai! What're you doin' here?

16:18.950 --> 16:21.390
I came to say that Moemi
can use the kitchen now.

16:21.460 --> 16:22.720
Moemi, go ahead.

16:24.160 --> 16:25.350
Okay.

16:30.060 --> 16:32.360
<i>I have a chance</i>
<i>to eat Moemi's cooking!</i>

16:32.430 --> 16:36.870
<i>There is no finer sight in the world</i>
<i>than a girl making dinner.</i>

16:36.940 --> 16:41.000
<i>Just her being here</i>
<i>makes the kitchen look alive again.</i>

16:54.420 --> 16:56.910
I don't know how good it is.

16:56.990 --> 16:59.320
Let's eat before it gets cold.

16:59.390 --> 17:01.730
It looks fantastic!

17:01.800 --> 17:03.260
Then have some!

17:03.330 --> 17:06.490
<i>Moemi's home cooking.</i>

17:17.740 --> 17:19.870
It... It...
It IS fantastic!

17:19.950 --> 17:23.440
It's the best I've had
in my entire life!

17:23.520 --> 17:26.490
- That's too much.
- But it is really good.

17:26.550 --> 17:27.950
Will you show me
how to make it?

17:28.020 --> 17:31.420
If you like it,
'course I will.

17:31.490 --> 17:36.490
<i>If only I could have this feeling</i>
<i>every day.</i>

17:38.530 --> 17:42.870
<i>Yota's gone bye-bye. But he's happy,</i>
<i>so I'll leave it at that.</i>

17:43.640 --> 17:46.800
<i>So much for my efforts.</i>
<i>Hello, Drano!</i>

17:52.510 --> 17:53.980
That was great!

17:54.620 --> 17:57.810
You don't have to--
At least let me make coffee.

17:57.890 --> 18:02.290
I'm fine. Have a seat.
It's my treat tonight.

18:11.200 --> 18:13.430
Guess I'd better get going.

18:13.500 --> 18:17.400
So, Ai?
Take Moemi home, please.

18:19.340 --> 18:23.330
I want to take her myself,
but I kinda ate myself sick.

18:23.410 --> 18:24.810
You're hopeless.

18:39.990 --> 18:42.490
That's a strange outfit.

18:43.930 --> 18:48.160
I... I... made it for
the Comic Market Convention.

18:48.240 --> 18:49.360
- "Comic Market"?
- Yeah.

18:49.440 --> 18:52.500
That's the excuse that Yota
told me to tell everybod--

18:53.210 --> 18:56.800
No! I, uh... by the way,
where did you meet my brother today?

18:56.880 --> 18:58.850
At a store.

18:58.910 --> 19:02.250
He was staring at a window display,
blushing furiously.

19:02.320 --> 19:04.790
I helped him shop a little.

19:04.850 --> 19:08.790
What an idiot!
Can't even go shopping!

19:08.860 --> 19:11.420
He's a lost cause.

19:11.490 --> 19:13.430
Not at all.

19:13.490 --> 19:15.690
He's a good brother who cares
about his little sister.

19:15.760 --> 19:16.730
Him!?

19:17.860 --> 19:20.930
He's good about
giving me advice.

19:21.000 --> 19:23.270
He gave some advice today?

19:23.340 --> 19:26.710
Not today. Today was my chance
to thank him.

19:28.510 --> 19:33.450
If I were to ask his advice,
he'd just get worried over me.

19:34.250 --> 19:37.220
He really is a nice guy,
you know?

19:47.230 --> 19:53.000
You know, I should have fallen in love
with Moteuchi instead.

20:08.820 --> 20:11.280
<i>Poor Yota.</i>

20:25.700 --> 20:28.100
All my effort was wasted.

20:28.170 --> 20:31.230
But it's all in a day's work
for a video girl.

20:31.940 --> 20:33.930
And Yota.

20:34.010 --> 20:37.440
"Moemi" this, "Moemi" that!
Like she's the only girl in the world.

20:41.450 --> 20:43.940
He's startin' to piss me off!

20:54.960 --> 20:55.930
I'm back!

20:56.000 --> 20:59.330
Already! Oh no!

20:59.400 --> 21:02.390
Is that so?

21:03.300 --> 21:05.300
You got a PROBLEM?

21:28.100 --> 21:31.000
How? How could you have known?

21:31.060 --> 21:35.000
I was gonna have it done
by the time you came back.

21:36.140 --> 21:39.700
A dog coulda hidden
it better'n you.

21:39.770 --> 21:41.670
Plus, your fingers--

21:46.810 --> 21:48.870
You surprised me.
It was good.

21:53.720 --> 21:55.150
Oh, that's right!

21:56.420 --> 21:58.520
Open the bag back there.

22:06.970 --> 22:10.530
I found it in a boutique
outside the mall.

22:10.600 --> 22:12.970
You're always helping me out--

22:13.040 --> 22:14.560
Thanks.

22:21.780 --> 22:23.810
It may be a little flashy.

22:23.880 --> 22:26.350
I wondered if you'd like it--

22:26.420 --> 22:30.050
W-What? D-Don't scare me!

22:31.360 --> 22:35.260
You start this serious stuff,
I'll fall for you.

22:35.330 --> 22:38.060
Stop that. You know
I only love Moemi.

22:38.130 --> 22:40.460
Don't worry.

22:40.530 --> 22:45.030
Video girls aren't able
to fall in love.

22:45.110 --> 22:47.100
T-They're not?

22:55.150 --> 22:56.550
<i>But--</i>

22:58.720 --> 23:00.150
<i>But--</i>

23:01.560 --> 23:05.050
<i>Why does my heart hurt so much?</i>

25:50.590 --> 25:52.120
You like it?

25:52.190 --> 25:54.860
Very much!

25:56.260 --> 25:58.290
All right!

25:59.830 --> 26:00.770
Over here!

26:01.740 --> 26:03.640
Alone?

26:03.700 --> 26:05.640
I'm dating Yota today.

26:07.770 --> 26:10.770
That's why you're "Dateless"!

26:10.840 --> 26:12.240
Moemi!

26:16.650 --> 26:18.380
Damn it!

26:18.450 --> 26:21.850
You're the one
who wanted to go out today.

26:21.920 --> 26:23.410
You're stupid, Ai!

26:23.490 --> 26:26.430
But you're no stupider
than I am.
